Twin Phantom, but she has since reconciled and become a friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After her transformation, she overwhelms her enemies with powerful attacks using her great sword."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c85553"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c5/c500b919e37983f723edc0482201c38d20f3155e4aa99620ae1e561a382cace9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/02/02104c01da492151cbca422a162f7c26a37a137e23777829d9ad37866f65eb32.webp","width":183,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"柚木 涼香","creatorId":"vndb:s495","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s495","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s495","name":"柚木 涼香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61434","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c85554","characterName":"葉月 つかさ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c85554"},"originalCharacterName":"葉月 つかさ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"808"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A scientist researching on the 'Holy Grail's Fragment' while serving as a temporary lecturer at St. Cherine's Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a prodigy who graduated from a postgraduate program by skipping grades and utilizes her knowledge and skills for her own activities as an 'Ama no Tsukai'. Her weapon of choice is a pair of pistols."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from the official site"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is actually Kurumi's aunt, who died in an accident eleven years ago. She assisted the time-traveling Kurumi and her frie